{
  "about": "Spec 118 6.2/6.3 (T-OV-JS): one fixture for hours.Across (Go) and the WUI's today/timer function. Each case: the person's zone, now, the workspace days (the input of Across) and want, the personal days it returns. Minutes are integers, instants RFC 3339 UTC.",
